        "A little slice of calm on the high street",
        "MMM Beauty was set up to bring genuinely good nail, brow and skin care to Brackley — no rushing, no upselling, just careful work from people who love what they do.",
        "Every appointment starts with a proper consultation, whether you're after your first set of gel nails, sharper brows for an event, or a facial that actually gives your skin a break. We use quality products, keep our tools properly sterilised, and take the time to get the details right.",
